## 二、Java：完整 PoolSelector

下面是按照你之前的 `PoolSelector` 结构整理的版本。

只改变两个地方：

1. `selectForSecurityContainer()`：增加 BMS 预留过滤。
2. `selectByRegionPriority()`：从比较单节点最大 CPU 改为比较扣除碎片预算后的整池剩余 CPU。

`SimplePoolScorer` 完全不改。

```
import java.util.Comparator;
import java.util.List;

public class PoolSelector {

    // BMS 预留配置，单位 mCPU
    private static final long BMS_BASE_RESERVED_CPU = 100_000L;
    private static final long BMS_RESERVED_CPU_PER_NODE = 3_000L;

    private final NodePoolRegistryQueryRepository nodePoolQuery;
    private final NodePoolFilter filter;

    public PoolSelector(
            NodePoolRegistryQueryRepository nodePoolQuery,
            NodePoolFilter filter) {
        this.nodePoolQuery = nodePoolQuery;
        this.filter = filter;
    }

    public NodePoolRegistry select(
            DevcsEntity devc,
            ContainerTypeEnum containerType) {

        List<NodePoolRegistry> nodePools = getNodePoolRegistries();

        List<NodePoolRegistry> filteredPools = nodePools.stream()
                .filter(p -> filter.matches(p, devc, containerType))
                .filter(p ->
                        containerType != ContainerTypeEnum.SECURITY_CONTAINER
                                || KUASAR_VMM.equals(p.getType()))
                .toList();

        String region = devc.getRegion();

        if (ContainerTypeEnum.SECURITY_CONTAINER == containerType) {
            return selectForSecurityContainer(
                    devc, filteredPools, nodePools);
        }

        if (filteredPools.isEmpty()) {
            throw new IllegalStateException(
                    "No available node pools");
        }

        return pickNodePoolRegistry(region, filteredPools);
    }

    private List<NodePoolRegistry> getNodePoolRegistries() {
        List<NodePoolRegistry> nodePools = nodePoolQuery.listAll();

        if (nodePools.isEmpty()) {
            throw new IllegalStateException(
                    "Node pool registry is empty");
        }

        return nodePools;
    }

    private NodePoolRegistry selectForSecurityContainer(
            DevcsEntity devc,
            List<NodePoolRegistry> pools,
            List<NodePoolRegistry> allNodePools) {

        // 新增：BMS 容量与预留检查
        long requestCpu = (long) devc.getCores() * 1000L;

        pools = pools.stream()
                .filter(p -> p.getAvailableNodes() > 0)
                .filter(p -> p.getMaxAvailableCores() >= requestCpu)
                .filter(p -> p.getSumAvailableCores() >=
                        requestCpu
                        + BMS_BASE_RESERVED_CPU
                        + BMS_RESERVED_CPU_PER_NODE * p.getAvailableNodes())
                .toList();

        // 原有 Fallback 逻辑保持不变
        boolean isFallback = false;

        if (pools.isEmpty()) {
            pools = fallbackToNormalContainer(devc, allNodePools);
            isFallback = true;
        }

        if (pools.isEmpty()) {
            throw new IllegalStateException(
                    "No available node pools for security container");
        }

        String region = devc.getRegion();

        return isFallback
                ? pickNodePoolRegistry(region, pools)
                : selectByRegionPriority(region, pools);
    }

    private NodePoolRegistry selectByRegionPriority(
            String region,
            List<NodePoolRegistry> pools) {

        List<String> regions =
                SimplePoolScorer.parsePriorityRegions(region);

        if (regions.isEmpty()) {
            throw new IllegalStateException(
                    "Priority regions are empty");
        }

        for (String rgn : regions) {
            NodePoolRegistry pool = pools.stream()
                    .filter(p -> rgn.equals(p.getRegion()))
                    .max(Comparator.comparingLong(p ->
                            p.getSumAvailableCores()
                                    - BMS_RESERVED_CPU_PER_NODE
                                    * p.getAvailableNodes()))
                    .orElse(null);

            if (pool != null) {
                return pool;
            }
        }

        throw new IllegalStateException(
                "No node pool found in priority regions");
    }

    private List<NodePoolRegistry> fallbackToNormalContainer(
            DevcsEntity devc,
            List<NodePoolRegistry> allNodePools) {

        return allNodePools.stream()
                .filter(p -> filter.matches(
                        p,
                        devc,
                        ContainerTypeEnum.CONTAINER))
                .filter(p -> COMMON_CCE.equals(p.getType()))
                .toList();
    }

    private NodePoolRegistry pickNodePoolRegistry(
            String region,
            List<NodePoolRegistry> pools) {

        List<SimplePoolScorer.NodePool> scorePools = pools.stream()
                .map(p -> new SimplePoolScorer.NodePool(
                        p,
                        p.getAllocatableNodes(),
                        p.getAvailableNodes()))
                .toList();

        return SimplePoolScorer.pickClusterUid(region, scorePools);
    }
}
```

这段保留了你原来 `KUASAR_VMM`、`COMMON_CCE` 等常量的使用方式；实际工程里继续使用原有的 import、业务异常和实体定义即可。

